           rdfs:comment "The dominant means used to transport, store, handle or display the trade item as defined by the data source. This packaging is not used to describe any manufacturing process. Data recipients can use this data for: o Space Planning o Data Accuracy (Tolerances) o Supply Chain processes o Recycling process (In combination with packaging materials) o Product buying/procurement decisions o Tax calculations/fees/duties calculation" ;
