                 rdfs:comment "The date from which the neutral trade item information (i.e. not the private information, not relationship-dependent data and not price data) is available to all members of the target data pool, without restriction. Until this date only the data recipients to whom the data source has explicitly published the data can have access to the data. By setting this date a data source gives permission for wider publication of the generic item data." ;
