                rdfs:comment "An optional additional phrase added to the Country of Origin Labelling such as \"with Australian Macadamias\" and Minor Processing information which must be in brackets () and is Mandatory if applicable. e.g. \"with Australian Macadamias (packed and washed in Indonesia)\"." ;
