              rdfs:comment "European Union. The economic association of over a dozen European countries which seek to create a unified, barrier-free market for products and services throughout the continent. Category of product eligible for EU subsidy (applies for certain dairy products with specific level of fat content. 1 Category I - full milk (>3,5 % fat) 2 Category II - standard milk (3,0 - 3,5 % fat) 5 Category V - medium fat milk (1,5 - 1,8 % fat)7 Category VII - low fat milk (<0,5 % fat)9 Category IX - other" ;
