              rdfs:comment "Vino de la tierra is a quality of Spanish wine that designates the rung below the mainstream quality wine indication of denominación de origen (DO). It is the equivalent of the French vin de pays. It covers not only still wine but also sparkling wine and fortified wine." ;
              rdfs:label "STILL_WINE_VINO_DE_LA_TIERRA" ;
