              rdfs:comment "Definition (includes Common Name): Refers to the presence of Tuna and its derivatives in the product. - Family/Genus/Species: Scombridae subfamily Scombrinae/(various) - Also known as: Albacore, Bigeye Tuna, Black Skipjack, Blackfin Tuna, Bluefin Tuna, Bullet Tuna, Buri, Dogtooth Tuna, Escolar, Frigate Tuna, Kawakawa, Little Tuna, Longtail Tuna, Pacific Bluefin Tuna, Skipjack Tuna, Slender Tuna, Southern Bluefin Tuna, Spotted Tunny, Tuna, Yellowfin Tuna - Disclaimer: Refers to the presence of the allergen in the product, as listed in the regulations specified by an agency and specification or any local market regulations." ;
