                       gdsn:c-512160160 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "\"Dairy\" cheese(artisanal or industrial) is made from milk from several farms, transformed into cheese in a dairy. Manufacturing is more or less automated, the milk is mixed and often standardized. The milk used can be raw, pasteurized, heat treated or micro-filtered." ;
