gdsn:cv171967 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c1120209087 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "(IPM) Plants grown using a pest control strategy that uses an array of complimentary methods: mechanical devices, physical devices, genetic, biological, legal, cultural management and chemical management. These methods are done in three stages: prevention, observation, and intervention. It is an ecological approach with a main goal of significantly reducing or eliminating the use of pesticides. array of complimentary methods: mechanical devices, physical devices, genetic, biological, legal, cultural management and chemical management. These methods are done in three stages: prevention, observation, and intervention. It is an ecological approach with a main goal of significantly reducing or eliminating the use of pesticides." ;
              rdfs:label "INTEGRATED_PEST_MANAGEMENT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "GrowingMethodCode" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "171967" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


