###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv172875
gdsn:cv172875 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c2147348125 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The watt-hour is a unit of energy equivalent to one watt of power expended for one hour of time; it is equal to 3.6 kilojoules. The watt-hour is rarely used to express energy in any form other than electrical." ;
