              rdfs:comment "Indication of the value of enterococcacea. The Enterococcaceae is a family of Gram-positive bacteria, placed within the order of Lactobacillales. Representative genera include Atopobacter, Enterococcus, Melissococcus, Pilibacter, Tetragenococcus, and Vagococcus. In this familiy are some important lactic acid bacterias (LAB) which produce lactic acid as the major metabolic end product." ;
