              rdfs:comment "GS1 Tagname Description: An indigestible synthetic polymer of dextrose/glucose. It is a food ingredient classified as soluble fiber by Health Canada. Expressed in grams. It is obtained by condensation of a melt consisting of approximately 90% glucose and 10% sorbitol in the presence of catalytic amounts of citric acid or phosphoric acid Business Rule: Unit of Measure should be provided is value is specified. - UOM for Nutrient Panel: - GS1 Notes, Keywords, and Examples: - GS1 Comment: GS1 temporary code - GS1 Synonyms:" ;
