###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv174089
gdsn:cv174089 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c2147348062 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Barley a hardy cereal that has coarse bristles extending from the ears. It is widely cultivated, chiefly for use in brewing and stock feed. The grain of the barley plant." ;
