              rdfs:comment "Hyaluronic acid is a moisture binder and belongs to the mucopolysaccharide. These are multiple sugars, i.e. long molecular chains, which are composed of disaccharide subunits (double sugars), which in turn consist of glucuronic acid and an amino sugar." ;
              rdfs:label "HYALURONIC_ACID" ;
