              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Low fat or reduced fat ice cream contains a lesser percent of total fat than the referenced product (either an average of leading brands, or the company's own brand). Please refer to target market regulations for definition of 'low fat'." ;
