              rdfs:comment "NP/NPEs, also known as nonylphenols and nonylphenol ethoxylates, are nonionic surfactants, or detergent-like substances, with uses that lead to widespread release into aquatic environments." ;
              rdfs:label "NONYLPHENOL_ETHOXYLATES" ;
