###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176467
gdsn:cv176467 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Originating from the Beauce and Champagne regions, AXEREAL is the leading cereal cooperative in France in the grain chain: collection, processing and trading. It has 13,000 members. Anxious to accompany its members towards a responsible agriculture approach, AXEREAL launches in 2017 a certification initiative for farmers: CULTIV UP. To show a strong commitment to the consumer: Your level of requirement goes beyond the \"Responsible\" base on one or more criteria. We can respond to your request by creating a chain and a complete traceability from the producer to the consumer." ;
              rdfs:label "CULTIVUP_EXIGENCE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.axereal.com/sites/default/files/imce/plaquette_cultivup_web.pdf" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176467" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176468
gdsn:cv176468 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Originating from the Beauce and Champagne regions, AXEREAL is the leading cereal cooperative in France in the grain chain: collection, processing and trading. It has 13,000 members. Anxious to accompany its members towards a responsible agriculture approach, AXEREAL launches in 2017 a certification initiative for farmers: CULTIV UP. To add a \"sustainable\" mention on your products: Your raw materials come from farmers who produce according to a shared vision of sustainability: that of the members of the SAI platform. It is based on social, economic and environmental criteria. For you, an annual mass balance is carried out on our sustainable raw material." ;
              rdfs:label "CULTIVUP_RESPONSABLE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.axereal.com/sites/default/files/imce/plaquette_cultivup_web.pdf" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176468" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176469
gdsn:cv176469 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "This logo can be only used on labels of food products made only or mostly from Czech ingredients and manufactured in the Czech Republic. Rules for using the logo are maintained by the Ministry of Agriculture of the Czech Republic and they are available at http://eagri.cz/public/web/mze/potraviny/znacky-kvality-potravin/ceska-potravina/ ." ;
              rdfs:label "CZECH_FOOD" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://eagri.cz/public/web/mze/potraviny/znacky-kvality-potravin/ceska-potravina/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176469" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176470
gdsn:cv176470 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Dallas Kosher Certification" ;
              rdfs:label "DALLAS_KOSHER" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.dallaskosher.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176470" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176471
gdsn:cv176471 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The objective of Danish I.P. gardeners and growers are producing fruits and vegetables of high quality in a holistic manner that is prudent to both nature and man. Integrated Production requires, e.g.. taking advantage of the natural regulatory and useful mechanisms in nature. The goal is to reduce the use of pesticides and fertilizer to the bare minimum. Documentation and independent control is the guarantee of security. Nothing is left to chance when Danish fruit and vegetables is grown by I.P. method." ;
              rdfs:label "DANSK_IP_KVALITET" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.dansk-ip.dk" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176471" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176472
gdsn:cv176472 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The purpose of DANSK MÆLK marque is to determine that the products sold - using the DANSK MÆLK marque - originates from Danish milk, is produced and packaged in Denmark. The DANSK MÆLK marque is owned by Danish Dairy Board (Mejeriforeningen). The DANSK MÆLK marque may only be used for milk, dairy and drinking milk products. Only members of the Dairy Board can use the DANSK MÆLK marque." ;
              rdfs:label "DANSK_MAELK" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.danskmaelk.dk/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176472" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176473
gdsn:cv176473 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "All providers of organic products in Norway are certified by Debio. We ensure that farms and fish farms, processing and marketing enterprises, importers and others follow the regulations for organic production, and meet the requirements for marketing organic products under Debio’s Ø-label. - See more at: http://www.debio.no/information-in-english#sthash.TttuMTn9.dpuf" ;
              rdfs:label "DEBIO" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://debio.no/english/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176473" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176474
gdsn:cv176474 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Organic winegrowing, organic winemaking and social standards" ;
              rdfs:label "DELINAT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.delinat.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176474" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176475
gdsn:cv176475 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Demeter International trademark for products of certified biodynamic production. www.demeter.net" ;
              rdfs:label "DEMETER_LABEL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.demeter.net" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176475" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176476
gdsn:cv176476 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Design for the Environment Safer Product Labeling Program advances the United States Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) mission to protect human health and the environment. The program uses EPA's chemical knowledge and resources to carefully evaluate products and to label only those that have met the program's leadership standard." ;
              rdfs:label "DESIGN_FOR_THE_ENVIRONMENT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.epa.gov/saferchoice/design-environment-programs-initiatives-and-projects" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176476" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176477
gdsn:cv176477 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Finnish label for designing." ;
              rdfs:label "DESIGN_FROM_FINLAND" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://designfromfinland.com/about/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176477" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176478
gdsn:cv176478 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Diamond K - Massechusetts Certification" ;
              rdfs:label "DIAMOND_K" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.congregationlubavitch.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176478" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176479
gdsn:cv176479 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Kashrut Authority of Australia and NZ Certification" ;
              rdfs:label "DIAMOND_KA_KASHRUT_AUTHORITY_OF_AUSTRALIA_AND_NZ" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ka.org.au/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176479" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176480
gdsn:cv176480 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Direct Trade is an ethical, responsible and social connection between farmers and manufacturing companies without any intermediaries, in a way that the created value is shared between both parties equally. Hence, both parties work in a symbiotic relationship, outputting labour and effort in order to maximize the value of the raw materials and finished goods and become dependent on each other´s success. There are various versions of this label." ;
              rdfs:label "DIRECT_TRADE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://direct-trade.org/#how_it_works" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176480" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176481
gdsn:cv176481 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The red Ø-mærke with the text \"Statskontrolleret økologisk\", tells that the Danish authorities have been controlling the farm or the company which have processed, packed or marked an organic product." ;
              rdfs:label "DK_ECO" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://eng.lbst.dk/agriculture/organic-farming/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176481" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176482
gdsn:cv176482 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "DLG award in bronze, silver and gold. The DLG promotes product quality of foods on the basis of binding and impartial quality standards, based on current scientific findings and the recognised test methods it has developed. With its International Tests the DLG leads quality assessment in Europe and is accredited in accordance with international norms." ;
              rdfs:label "DLG_AWARD" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.dlg.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176482" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176483
gdsn:cv176483 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Indicates that on the basis of the allergen management and risk assessment, the product is assessed that it will not cause allergic reactions in the majority of the allergic population. The label \"DLG-certified allergen management\" is awarded by the DLG TestService GmbH in cooperation with the German Allergy and Asthma Federation e.V. (DAAB)." ;
              rdfs:label "DLG_CERTIFIED_ALLERGEN_MANAGEMENT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176483" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176484
gdsn:cv176484 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "DNV Business Assurance part of DNV GL (Det Norske Veritas) \"the Norwegian truth\" is one of the world's leading certification bodies, helping businesses assure the performance of their organization, products, people, facilities and supply chains through certification, verification, assessment, and training services. They certify the compliance of companies according to a third party standard, such as ISO 9001 (quality management system) or ISO 14001 (environmental management system)." ;
              rdfs:label "DNV_BUSINESS_ASSURANCE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.dnvgl.com/about/business-assurance/index.html" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176484" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176485
gdsn:cv176485 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Earth Island Institute monitors tuna companies around the world to ensure the tuna is caught by methods that do not harm dolphins and protect the marine ecosystem." ;
              rdfs:label "DOLPHIN_SAFE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.earthisland.org/dolphinSafeTuna/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176485" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176486
gdsn:cv176486 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Donau Soja programme has been established to promote and propagate the cultivation, processing and marketing of GM-free, origin-controlled quality soya from the Danube Region. Our aim is to develop and guarantee a GM-free protein supply in Europe." ;
              rdfs:label "DONAU_SOYA_STANDARD" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.donausoja.org/en/certification/standards/donau-soja-standard/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176486" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176487
gdsn:cv176487 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Dermatology Review Panel™, a division of DRP Dermatology Inc. (\"DRP\") has been formed to provide an independent dermatologists' review of non-prescription skin care products (includes over-the-counter and other consumer products with skin care-related claims)." ;
              rdfs:label "DRP" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.dermatologyreviewpanel.ca/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176487" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176488
gdsn:cv176488 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "This label is awarded to farmers that comply with strict regulations for the well-being of both pigs and the environment. The compliance to these guidelines is reviewed yearly by independent certification bodies." ;
              rdfs:label "DUURZAAM_VARKENSVLEES" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://duurzaamvarkensvlees.nl/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176488" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176489
gdsn:cv176489 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The label of 'Vegan' from the The Vegetarian Society of Denmark, also known as Dansk Vegetarisk Forening (DVF), is a label to trust with stricter requirements than most other vegan labels. Besides the normal requirements for vegan, then products are not allowed to be tested on animals either for this vegan label. The logo is a registered trademark." ;
              rdfs:label "DVF_VEGAN" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://vegetarisk.dk/maerkningsordning" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176489" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176490
gdsn:cv176490 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The label of 'Vegetarian' from the The Vegetarian Society of Denmark, also known as Dansk Vegetarisk Forening (DVF), is a label to trust with stricter requirements than most other vegetarian labels. Besides the normal requirements for vegetarian, then any product from animals should be organic for this vegetarian label. The logo is a registered trademark." ;
              rdfs:label "DVF_VEGETARIAN" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://vegetarisk.dk/maerkningsordning" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176490" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176491
gdsn:cv176491 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The requirements for the label \"Recommended by Animal Protection Association \" is focused on animal welfare in production, transport and accommodation at the slaughterhouse and may be summarized in five points: 1. Animals must always have the freedom to move freely and be able to exhibit normal behaviour. 2. Animals must not be harmed physically or mentally. 3. Animals must not starve, but should have free access to natural feedstuffs and water so that they can maintain good health and vigour. 4. Animals must not be unnecessarily exposed to infection or suffer any harm. 5. Animals must not in any way be intimidated or unduly stressed." ;
              rdfs:label "DYRENES_BESKYTTELSE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.dyrenesbeskyttelse.dk/anbefalet-af-dyrenes-beskyttelse (The site is only in Danish)" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176491" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176492
gdsn:cv176492 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The German Coeliac Society (Deutsche Zöliakiegesellschaft – DZG) was founded 1974. Today the DZG has more than 40,000 members. The aim is to help people with coeliac disease or with Dermatitis Herpetiformis Duhring. The organisation also try to increase the publicity of coeliac disease and to improve the living conditions for coeliacs in Germany." ;
              rdfs:label "DZG_GLUTEN_FREE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.dzg-online.de" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176492" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176493
gdsn:cv176493 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "EarthKosher Kosher Certification" ;
              rdfs:label "EARTHKOSHER_KOSHER" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.earthkosher.com" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176493" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176494
gdsn:cv176494 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Earthsure is the Ecolabel program of IERE. It provides environmental product declarations, or Environmental Product Declarations. Much like a nutrition label the EPD shows some or all of the following impacts: climate change, depletion of the stratospheric ozone layer, acidification of land and water sources & other impacts." ;
              rdfs:label "EARTHSURE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://iere.org/programs/earthsure/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176494" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176495
gdsn:cv176495 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The products and services we certify have been fully adapted to the needs of allergy sufferers. An independent advisory panel of 15 leading international scientists and technicians has developed the criteria we use to evaluate different product groups, such as creams, vacuum cleaners and hotels. They include threshold values and exclusion criteria that make an allergic reaction very unlikely. The criteria are regularly updated to reflect the latest scientific findings. A product receives the Seal when it can be proved through audits or studies that the criteria have been fulfilled." ;
              rdfs:label "ECARF_SEAL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.ecarf-institute.org/en/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176495" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176496
gdsn:cv176496 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Corresponds to printers and fax machines, for the health and environmental criteria audited by TÜV Rheinland: www.tuv.com." ;
              rdfs:label "ECO_KREIS" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.label-online.de/label-datenbank?label=520" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176496" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176497
gdsn:cv176497 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Mark accredited to products with low impact on environment. It is accredited by CENIA - Czech Environmental Information Agency of the Ministry of Environment of the Czech Republic." ;
              rdfs:label "ECO_LABEL_CZECH" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://ekoznacka.cz/ekoznaceni/ekoznacka-esv-a-ess" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176497" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176498
gdsn:cv176498 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "This is a Finnish label used by the Organic union, which represents the entire Finnish organic industry, consumers and producers in a common interest group. They work as a neutral voice in various working groups and consultations, and prepare position papers and presentations. The Federation also organizes training events and professional seminars. The Organic Federation also publishes the magazine Organic." ;
              rdfs:label "ECO_LABEL_LADYBUG" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://luomu.fi/ruoka/luomumerkit/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176498" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176499
gdsn:cv176499 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Formerly known as Environmental Choice. North America's leading benchmark of environmentally responsible products and services." ;
              rdfs:label "ECO_LOGO" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ecologo.org/en/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176499" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176500
gdsn:cv176500 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "ECOCERT is a certification body for sustainable development. Www.ecocert.com" ;
              rdfs:label "ECOCERT_CERTIFICATE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.ecocert.com" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176500" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176501
gdsn:cv176501 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The COSMOS-standard certification was officially launched at the Biofach in February. The COSMOS-standard is a new cosmetic certification developed to harmonize various certifications and labels in order to create one standard that is internationally recognized for natural and organic cosmetics. The new certification is a result of Europe’s leading natural cosmetic certifiers coming together and forming a non-profit association, COSMOS-standard AISBL." ;
              rdfs:label "ECOCERT_COSMOS_NATURAL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.cosmos-standard.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176501" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176502
gdsn:cv176502 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The COSMOS-standard certification was officially launched at the Biofach in February. The COSMOS-standard is a new cosmetic certification developed to harmonize various certifications and labels in order to create one standard that is internationally recognized for natural and organic cosmetics. The new certification is a result of Europe’s leading natural cosmetic certifiers coming together and forming a non-profit association, COSMOS-standard AISBL." ;
              rdfs:label "ECOCERT_COSMOS_ORGANIC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.cosmos-standard.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176502" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176503
gdsn:cv176503 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Ecocert (Canada) is a control and certification organization that certifies organic products in Canada with its Ecocert label. It is managed by a private corporation based in Quebec, but that operates Canada-wide and is independent from all commercial entities" ;
              rdfs:label "ECOCERT_ORGANIC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ecocertcanada.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176503" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176504
gdsn:cv176504 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Ecogarantie is an international mark for ecological products. Ecogarantie has developed standards for cosmetics, personal care, washing- and cleaning products and salt. Consumers can rely on the fact that products with the Ecogarantie label, meet strict requirements whose goal it is to guarantee quality, safety and durability for generations to come. http://www.ecogarantie.com/en ." ;
              rdfs:label "ECOGARANTIE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ecogarantie.eu/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176504" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176505
gdsn:cv176505 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Ecoland label stands for regional production, sustainable agriculture and social commitment. Products with this label have not been treated with chemical pesticides or synthetic fertilizers. Producers commits itself to promote the biodiversity of their area, to preserve soil fertility and to use water-efficient irrigation systems. All organic farmers are controlled in accordance with the strict requirements of the EU Organic Regulation and the guidelines of the Ecoland-Verband. This is done by state-approved inspection bodies, which are supervised by the state control authorities" ;
              rdfs:label "ECOLAND" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ecoland.de/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176505" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176506
gdsn:cv176506 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The EcoLogo certification attribute includes all products that have published the EcoLogo Certified seal on their packaging." ;
              rdfs:label "ECOLOGO_CERTIFIED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ul.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176506" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176507
gdsn:cv176507 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The ecovin label certifies wines produced with ecological production methods based on the EU eco regulation." ;
              rdfs:label "ECOVIN" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ecovin.de/de/ecovin.htm" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176507" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176508
gdsn:cv176508 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Products that are identified as ‘accepted’ by the Eczema Society are free of ingredients know to be irritating for sensitive skin, have undergone dermatologist formulation review, and have earned our Seal of Acceptance." ;
              rdfs:label "ECZEMA_SOCIETY_OF_CANADA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://eczemahelp.ca/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176508" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176509
gdsn:cv176509 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Estonian Eco Label: Ministry of Agriculture Ökomärk (Label of Organic Food). www.agri.ee" ;
              rdfs:label "EESTI_OKOMARK" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.agri.ee" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176509" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176510
gdsn:cv176510 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Best Food - Association of Estonia Food Industry http://www.toiduliit.ee/ Our mission is to support and promote Estonian food industry and economy, and contribute to a balanced and appropriate ethics to members of a favorable business environment for development." ;
              rdfs:label "EESTI_PARIM_TOIDUAINE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.toiduliit.ee/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176510" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176511
gdsn:cv176511 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "This symbol stands for organic production certified by Skal that meets the requirements of the EU-regulation for organic production. Skal is the inspection body for the organic production in the Netherlands." ;
              rdfs:label "EKO" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.eko-keurmerk.nl/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176511" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176512
gdsn:cv176512 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "ENEC is a European high quality mark for lighting equipment and related products and stands for European Norms Electrical Certification. ENEC is an alternative to the national marks within the entire European Union. This mark eliminates a producer the need for a separate label in each individual country. Each European country there are 1 or more independent testing bodies that are appointed to issue the ENEC certification mark to a product." ;
              rdfs:label "ENEC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.enec.com" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176512" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176513
gdsn:cv176513 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Energy label A The EU energy label gives information about the energy efficiency of a product. The label rates products from dark green (most efficient) to red (least efficient). The label also shows total energy consumption and provides other information relevant to that product. Examples of products are lamps (light bulbs) and electric household appliances." ;
              rdfs:label "ENERGY_LABEL_A" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://ec.europa.eu/growth/single-market/european-standards/harmonised-standards/ecodesign/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176513" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


