###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176573
gdsn:cv176573 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Seal for meat from organic farming. Label owned by Fidelia Biofreiland AG." ;
              rdfs:label "FIDELIO" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.fidelio.ch/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176573" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176574
gdsn:cv176574 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The heart symbol to inform the consumer at one glance that the product marked with this symbol is a preferred choice in its product group with regard to fat and sodium. Finnish Heart Association www.sydanmerkki.fi" ;
              rdfs:label "FINNISH_HEART_SYMBOL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.sydanmerkki.fi" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176574" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176575
gdsn:cv176575 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "FishWise certification defines sustainable seafood as coming from sources, whether fished or farmed, that can maintain or increase production in the future without jeopardizing the structure or function of affected ecosystems." ;
              rdfs:label "FISH_WISE_CERTIFICATION" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.fishwise.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176575" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176576
gdsn:cv176576 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Flamme Verte label was launched in France in 2000 by l’Agence de l'Environnement et de la Maîtrise de l'Energie (ADEME), and manufacturers of household appliances. Its mission: to promote the use of wood processing heating appliances of which the design responds to the most demanding quality in terms of fuel efficiency and emissions. In addition, Flamme verte provides assurance that its products are environmentally friendly by emitting very few fine particles." ;
              rdfs:label "FLAMME_VERTE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.flammeverte.org" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176576" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176577
gdsn:cv176577 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Flandria is the Belgian quality label for fruits and vegetables. It is used by the six most important fruit-and-vegetable auctions grouped under LAVA. Since its inception in 1995, the Flandria label has given added value to fresh products and produce. This seal of approval guarantees concern and care for the environment during their cultivation, plus quality and freshness." ;
              rdfs:label "FLANDRIA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://flandria.be/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176577" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176578
gdsn:cv176578 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The French agricultural organizations have created a common visual identity in order to highlight the French origin of agricultural products in this case flowers: the signatures \"Agricultural Products of France\". Remarkable to their elegant silhouette in a tricolor pentagon that is available for each family of products, these signatures reflect the commitment of the professionals of the sectors to value the know-how, the territories and the French jobs. Covering a variety of productions, these signatures all have a common basis, which consists of four criteria: Origin France of the products concerned, The existence of specifications or regulations governing the use of the logo, A formal commitment from the operators of the sectors concerned wishing to use these logos, Controls performed by a third party." ;
              rdfs:label "FLEURS_DE_FRANCE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.produitsagricolesdefrance.fr" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176578" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176579
gdsn:cv176579 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Monash University identified a group of short-chain carbohydrates found in food that are either poorly absorbed in the small intestine or impossible to digest. The Monash team named these carbohydrates FODMAPs, an acronym which stands for Fermentable Oligosaccharides, Disaccharides, Monosaccharides, and Polyols. This accreditation signifies the product can be used in a low FODMAP diet which can reduce symptoms in people with Irritable Bowel Syndrome (IBS). https://www.monashfodmap.com" ;
              rdfs:label "FODMAP" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.monashfodmap.com" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176579" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176580
gdsn:cv176580 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Fermentable Oligosaccharides, Disaccharides, Monosaccharides, and Polyols (FODMAP) Friendly certification (Fodmap Accreditation) program, incorporating the FODMAP Friendly logo, is the only registered certification trademark worldwide certifying FODMAP levels in food products that have been laboratory tested to be low in FODMAP’s. It is designed to enable consumers with symptoms of Irritable Bowel Syndrome (IBS) who are following a Low FODMAP diet to easily identify and select suitable packaged food products." ;
              rdfs:label "FODMAP_FRIENDLY" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://fodmapfriendly.com/the-fodmap-friendly-program/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176580" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176581
gdsn:cv176581 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Food Alliance Certified attribute includes all products that present a Food Alliance Certified logo." ;
              rdfs:label "FOOD_ALLIANCE_CERTIFIED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://foodalliance.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176581" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176582
gdsn:cv176582 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Food Justice Certified is a label based on high-bar social justice standards for farms, processors, and retailers, including every link in the food chain from farm to table. Our approach is holistic; we ensure fair treatment of workers, fair pricing for farmers, and fair business practices. Food Justice Certified is designed for all agricultural production systems, fiber and cosmetics as well as food." ;
              rdfs:label "FOOD_JUSTICE_CERTIFIED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.agriculturaljusticeproject.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176582" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176583
gdsn:cv176583 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The FSSC 22000 Food Safety Management System provides a framework for effectively managing your organization's food safety responsibilities. FSSC 22000 is fully recognized by the Global Food Safety Initiative (GFSI) and is based on existing ISO Standards. It demonstrates your company has a robust Food Safety Management System in place that meets the requirements of your customers and consumers. Already, 10.000+ organizations over 140 countries achieved FSSC 22000 certification. With currently 100+ Licensed Certification Bodies and over 1,500 auditors worldwide, our mission is to ensure consumer trust in the supply of safe food and drinks." ;
              rdfs:label "FOOD_SAFETY_SYSTEM_CERTIFICATION_22000" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.fssc22000.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176583" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176584
gdsn:cv176584 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Foodland Ontario is a consumer promotion program of the Ontario Ministry of Agriculture and Food. It has partnered with producers to champion, promote and support the consumption of fresh Ontario produce and processed agricultural foods." ;
              rdfs:label "FOODLAND_ONTARIO" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ontario.ca/foodland-ontario" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176584" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176585
gdsn:cv176585 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Demonstration of social and fair business practices; providing good working conditions, guaranteeing the fair treatment of employees and the community and environmental responsibility." ;
              rdfs:label "FOR_LIFE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.fairforlife.org/pmws/indexDOM.php?client_id=fairforlife&page_id=home&lang_iso639=en" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176585" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176586
gdsn:cv176586 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "At least 70% of the input used to make this product line has been tracked and monitored from its point of origin (a Z809 certified forest) to the end consumer. This mark appears on product and/or packaging. None of the wood-based raw materials shall have come from Controversial Sources." ;
              rdfs:label "FOREST_PRODUCTS_Z809" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.csasfmforests.ca/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176586" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176587
gdsn:cv176587 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "FSC is a global, not-for-profit organization dedicated to the promotion of responsible forest management worldwide. The 100% label stands for products containing 100% material from FSC certified forests." ;
              rdfs:label "FOREST_STEWARDSHIP_COUNCIL_100_PERCENT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.fsc.org" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176587" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176588
gdsn:cv176588 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The item is physically marked with the Forest Stewardship Council label." ;
              rdfs:label "FOREST_STEWARDSHIP_COUNCIL_LABEL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://ic.fsc.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176588" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176589
gdsn:cv176589 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "FSC is a global, not-for-profit organization dedicated to the promotion of responsible forest management worldwide. Products with material from FSC certified forests , recycled materials or other controlled sources." ;
              rdfs:label "FOREST_STEWARDSHIP_COUNCIL_MIX" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.fsc.org" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176589" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176590
gdsn:cv176590 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "FSC is a global, not-for-profit organization dedicated to the promotion of responsible forest management worldwide. The label stand for products containing only recycled material." ;
              rdfs:label "FOREST_STEWARDSHIP_COUNCIL_RECYCLED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.fsc.org" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176590" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176591
gdsn:cv176591 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Foundation ART has the aim to increase the level of anti-theft prevention of two-wheeled vehicles (bicycles, mopeds, scooters and motor cycles). Anti-theft prevention of two-wheeled vehicles can be promoted by influencing social behaviour, registration and tracing, guarded shelters and anti-theft provisions. The activities of Foundation ART are focussed on (mechanical) anti-theft provisions. The Foundation ART promotes the safety provisions against theft by: •arranging requirements for mechanical security systems for two-wheeled vehicles •testing (by third parties) of systems for which an application for homologation was submitted •certification of approved products •promoting the use of approved mechanical security systems." ;
              rdfs:label "FOUNDATION_ART" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.stichtingart.nl" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176591" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176592
gdsn:cv176592 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "In composite products, i.e. a product with at least one added ingredient, at least 75% to be Swedish (water does not count). Bread, cheese and fruit yogurt are examples of composite products. Meat, eggs and raw milk should always be 100% Swedish, even as an ingredient in a product. All animals must be born, raised and slaughtered in Sweden. Cultivation should have taken place in Sweden. All processing and packaging must take place in Sweden." ;
              rdfs:label "FRAN_SVERIGE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://fransverige.se/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176592" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176593
gdsn:cv176593 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "France Limousin meat is meat that is constantly monitored from birth to slaughter. Every animal has it's own unique registration number and when exported is assigned an official certificate of origin." ;
              rdfs:label "FRANCE_LIMOUSIN_MEAT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.francelimousin.eu" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176593" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176594
gdsn:cv176594 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The yellow triangle with the flower is only awarded to food and firms that adhere strictly to the principles of organic farming and beyond the highest standards of animal husbandry." ;
              rdfs:label "FREILAND" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.freiland.or.at/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176594" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176595
gdsn:cv176595 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Certification: based on ISO14001. Private non profit owned by Australian horticultural industry bodies. Can certify that a code of practice exists for Viticulture/Winery, only Viticulture or only Winery. Process based and based on ISO14001. Described as a guide how to manage business risk through identification and evaluation. https://www.freshcare.com.au/" ;
              rdfs:label "FRESHCARE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.freshcare.com.au/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176595" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176596
gdsn:cv176596 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Friend of the Sea Approved Fisheries: - target stocks which are not overexploited - use fishing methods which don't impact the seabed, and - generate less than average 8% discards." ;
              rdfs:label "FRIEND_OF_THE_SEA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.friendofthesea.org" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176596" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176597
gdsn:cv176597 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The French agricultural organizations have created a common visual identity in order to highlight the French origin of agricultural products in this case fruit and legumes: the signatures \"Agricultural Products of France\". Remarkable to their elegant silhouette in a tricolor pentagon that is available for each family of products, these signatures reflect the commitment of the professionals of the sectors to value the know-how, the territories and the French jobs. Covering a variety of productions, these signatures all have a common basis, which consists of four criteria: Origin France of the products concerned, The existence of specifications or regulations governing the use of the logo, A formal commitment from the operators of the sectors concerned wishing to use these logos, Controls performed by a third party." ;
              rdfs:label "FRUITS_ET_LEGUMES_DE_FRANCE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.produitsagricolesdefrance.fr" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176597" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176598
gdsn:cv176598 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Gäa is a diverse farming association for farmers, processors and traders inside. The focal point is Germany. Gäa is a special design for the structure of the organic farming." ;
              rdfs:label "GAA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.gaea.de" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176598" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176599
gdsn:cv176599 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Ganeden® BC30 (Bacillus coagulans GBI-30, 6086) is a patented probiotic ingredient which can be found in food, beverage, sports nutrition and companion animal products. Unlike most other probiotic strains, Ganeden® BC30 is a spore-former which makes it highly stable and allows it to remain viable through most manufacturing processes, three years of shelf life and the low pH of stomach acid. https://www.ganedenprobiotics.com" ;
              rdfs:label "GANEDEN_BC30_PROBIOTIC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.ganedenprobiotics.com" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176599" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176600
gdsn:cv176600 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Animal Welfare Certified - Base Certification: Base certification is our minimum G.A.P. animal welfare certification level. This means that all of the farms and/or ranches raising the animal have met over 100+ animal welfare standards including more space to move around, and no cages or crates that would confine them. When you see our G.A.P. Animal Welfare Certified label, it means that the animals were raised without antibiotics and no added hormones, and were also fed a vegetarian diet with no animal by-products." ;
              rdfs:label "GAP_1" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://globalanimalpartnership.org/certified-gap" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176600" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176601
gdsn:cv176601 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Animal Welfare Certified - Enriched Environment: Animals were raised in environments that provide them with more space and additional enrichments (such as straw bales and perches) to encourage natural behaviors. Again, all G.A.P. certified animals were raised without antibiotics or any added hormones, and were fed a vegetarian diet with no animal by-products." ;
              rdfs:label "GAP_2" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://globalanimalpartnership.org/certified-gap" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176601" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176602
gdsn:cv176602 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Animal Welfare Certified - Outdoor Access: Animals have the choice of indoor or outdoor living (weather permitting for poultry), and also have additional enrichments indoors and out. At this level, farms and ranches ensure the animals are managed in both environments." ;
              rdfs:label "GAP_3" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://globalanimalpartnership.org/certified-gap" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176602" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176603
gdsn:cv176603 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Animal Welfare Certified - Pasture Raised: Animals are raised on pasture year-round. In some climates where pastures need to be protected for use the next year, animals must still be given daily access to outdoor areas. Cattle, sheep, goats and bison are not permitted to be finished in feedlots. Farmers and ranchers raise animals that are well suited for outdoor living, and sustainably manage their environments." ;
              rdfs:label "GAP_4" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://globalanimalpartnership.org/certified-gap" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176603" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176604
gdsn:cv176604 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Animal Welfare Certified - Animal Centered: Animals live on pasture year-round, with protection from the environment (shelters, windbreak, etc.). Farmers and ranchers raise animals that are well suited for outdoor living, and sustainably manage their environments. No physical alterations are performed on any of the animals (e.g. castration, tail docking, etc)." ;
              rdfs:label "GAP_5" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://globalanimalpartnership.org/certified-gap" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176604" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176605
gdsn:cv176605 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Animal Welfare Certified - Entire Life on Farm: This is our top tier of animal welfare certification. All of the requirements of the Animal Centered level are met (animals live on pasture year round with protection, no physical alterations allowed, etc.) but animals are also processed on-farm, or through the use of a mobile slaughter facility, so their entire life is spent on the farm." ;
              rdfs:label "GAP_5_PLUS" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://globalanimalpartnership.org/certified-gap" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176605" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176606
gdsn:cv176606 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Gaskeur is a hallmark of KIWA. The label is applied voluntarily in the Netherlands to boilers. It indicates the additional standards the installation complies with, above the legal requirements that the equipment must meet. It is an addition to the CE mark." ;
              rdfs:label "GASKEUR" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.kiwa.nl" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176606" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176607
gdsn:cv176607 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "GASTEC QA (Quality Approved) is a quality mark for gas related products and is issued exclusively by KIWA. GASTEC QA not only makes the quality and safety of the product itself visible but also of the whole production process." ;
              rdfs:label "GASTEC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.kiwa.nl" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176607" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176608
gdsn:cv176608 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The GCP logo is the key identifier of the Global Coffee Platform. It symbolizes the core attributes that are at the heart of what the organization does: farmer-centric, multi-stakeholder, inclusive, shared responsibility." ;
              rdfs:label "GCP" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.globalcoffeeplatform.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176608" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176609
gdsn:cv176609 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Quality seal for fairly traded and socially acceptable products from the south. Label owned by gebana." ;
              rdfs:label "GEBANA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https:/www.gebana.com" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176609" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176610
gdsn:cv176610 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "GENUSS REGION ÖSTERREICH is an initiative of the Agrarmarkt Austria Marketing GesmbH. and the Austrian Federal Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry, Environment and Water Management. It stands for domestic and regional agricultural products and specialities. www.gutes.at" ;
              rdfs:label "GENUSS_REGION_AUSTRIA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.gutes.at" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176610" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176611
gdsn:cv176611 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Geprüfte Sicherheit (\"Tested Safety\") or GS mark is a voluntary certification mark for technical equipment. It indicates that the equipment meets German and, if available, European safety requirements for such devices." ;
              rdfs:label "GEPRUEFTE_SICHERHEIT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.tuv.com/de/deutschland/gk/produktpruefung/pruefzeichen_zerftifizierungen/gs_zeichen/gs_zeichen.jsp" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176611" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176612
gdsn:cv176612 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Identifies basic staple products (such as fruit, milk, bread, etc.) that constitute a healthier choice for consumers because of their higher nutritional value in comparison to similar products according to the guidelines of the Dutch Wetenschappelijke Commissie. See: http://www.ikkiesbewust.nl/" ;
              rdfs:label "GEZONDERE_KEUZE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ikkiesbewust.nl/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176612" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176613
gdsn:cv176613 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Gluten-Free Certification Organization (GFCO) is a program of The Gluten Intolerance Group. GFCO’s Scientific and Professional Board review the practices of GFCO. GFCO inspects products and manufacturing facilities for gluten. GFCO does not certify products for other potential allergens. The contents of this site are not intended as medical advice." ;
              rdfs:label "GFCO" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.gfco.org/ https://www.gluten.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176613" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176614
gdsn:cv176614 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Gluten-Free Certification Program (GFCP), Endorsed by the National Foundation for Celiac Awareness (NFCA)- The National Foundation for Celiac Awareness endorsed Gluten-Free Certification Program (GFCP) is a voluntary certification program designed to designate trusted gluten-free products in the marketplace by displaying the NFCA certification trademark. Based on a robust third-party audit certification process at the manufacturing facility, the GFCP verifies that the manufacturing process for a product regularly meets stringent requirements for managing gluten as part of their food safety programs. The GFCP is a North American solution, using a single process to certify products for distribution in the US and Canada." ;
              rdfs:label "GFCP" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.glutenfreecert.com/about-us/gluten-free-certification-program" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176614" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176615
gdsn:cv176615 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Gluten-Free Food Services (GFFS) Training and Accreditation Program, a program of GIG, is designed to work with all food service establishments who wish to provide for and serve gluten-free consumers. GFFS works with experts in food preparation to develop, educate, and train service establishments to meet and adhere to the highest gluten-free standards." ;
              rdfs:label "GIG_GLUTEN_FREE_FOODSERVICE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.gluten.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176615" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176616
gdsn:cv176616 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Global Care\" represents our commitment to social and environmental responsibility worldwide. As a leader in innovative lighting solutions, we are dedicated to products and processes that contribute to solving global sustainability challenges, address economic needs and protect the environment for today and for the future. That way we ensure sustainable development not only for the company, but also for society and the environment." ;
              rdfs:label "GLOBAL_CARE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://xmlamp.com/news/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176616" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176618
gdsn:cv176618 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Global Organic Latex Standard certification attribute includes all products that have published the Global Organic Latex Standard seal on their packaging." ;
              rdfs:label "GLOBAL_ORGANIC_LATEX_STANDARD" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://controlunion.com/en/services/certifications/sustainability/gols-global-organic-latex-standard" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176618" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176619
gdsn:cv176619 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Global Organic Textile Standard (GOTS) ensure organic status of textiles, from harvesting of the raw materials, through environmentally and socially responsible manufacturing up to labelling in order to provide credible assurance to the consumer." ;
              rdfs:label "GLOBAL_ORGANIC_TEXTILE_STANDARD" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.global-standard.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176619" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176620
gdsn:cv176620 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Global Recycled Standard is intended for companies that are making and/or selling products with recycled content. The standard applies to the full supply chain and addresses traceability, environmental principles, social requirements, and labeling. Developed with the textile industry in mind, the GRS may also be applied to products from any industry." ;
              rdfs:label "GLOBAL_RECYCLED_STANDARD" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://certifications.controlunion.com/en/certification-programs/certification-programs/grs-global-recycle-standard" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176620" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176621
gdsn:cv176621 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Glycemic Index Foundation certification includes all products that have published the Glycemic Index Foundation stamp on their package." ;
              rdfs:label "GLYCAEMIC_INDEX_FOUNDATION" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.gisymbol.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176621" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176622
gdsn:cv176622 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Glycaemic Research Institute certification includes all products that have published the Glycemic Research Institute stamp on their package." ;
              rdfs:label "GLYCAEMIC_RESEARCH_INSTITUTE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.glycemic.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176622" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176623
gdsn:cv176623 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The GMO-Guard from Natural Food Certifiers certification includes all products that have published the GMO-Guard from Natural Food Certifiers stamp on their package." ;
              rdfs:label "GMO_GUARD_FROM_NATURAL_FOOD_CERTIFIERS" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://nfccertification.com/extra-view/gmo-guard/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176623" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176624
gdsn:cv176624 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The item is physically marked as of genetically modified origin." ;
              rdfs:label "GMO_MARKED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "0" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176624" ;
