              rdfs:comment "The Royal Association of Belgian Gas companies (ARGB) unites the natural gas suppliers and distribution system operators who are active in Belgium. The Association's role is to ensure the safety and good functioning of natural gas lands as well as to promote a good image for the use natural gas." ;
