              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The MSC is the world's leading certification and ecolabelling program for sustainable seafood. Look for the blue MSC ecolabel when shopping or dining out. The item is physically marked with the Marine Stewardship Council label." ;
