                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Mom’s Choice Awards® (MCA) evaluates products and services created for children, families and educators. The program is globally recognized for establishing the benchmark of excellence in family-friendly media, products and services. The organization is based in the United States and has reviewed thousands of items from more than 55 countries." ;
