gdsn:cv176778 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Since 2001, Consorzio Mortadella Bologna has brought together the major producers of this fantastic product, guaranteeing that Mortadella Bologna IGP is safe and guaranteed due to controls; is high quality, made from a traditional, simple and authentic recipe; is produced in Italy; has the characteristic, recognizable and appealing smell." ;
