                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The North American Olive Oil Association (NAOOA) offers a Certified Quality Seal Program as a way to recognize and promote olive oils that measure up to the industry's standards of excellence." ;
              rdfs:label "NAOOA_CERTIFIED_QUALITY" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.aboutoliveoil.org/certified-olive-oil-list" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176784" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176785
gdsn:cv176785 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Napa Green Vineyard certification provides a pathway for growers to improve soil health, become carbon neutral to negative, and increase the resilience of vineyards, businesses, and our community." ;
              rdfs:label "NAPA_GREEN_VINEYARD" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://napagreen.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176785" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176786
gdsn:cv176786 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Napa Green is one of only four sustainable winegrowing programs nationwide offering the opportunity for comprehensive soil to bottle certification in both the vineyard and winery. 40% of all of the certified sustainable wineries in California are in Napa County." ;
              rdfs:label "NAPA_GREEN_WINERY" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://napagreen.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176786" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176787
gdsn:cv176787 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The National Association for Sustainable Agriculture Australia (NASAA) plays a critically important role in supporting and promoting the adoption of sustainable agricultural practices that lead to safer and more sustainable food production systems. Our subsidiary business, NASAA Certified Organic (NCO), certifies organic commodities to meet all domestic and international export market requirements." ;
              rdfs:label "NASAA_CERTIFIED_ORGANIC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://nasaaorganic.org.au/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176787" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176788
gdsn:cv176788 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The NATRUE Label guarantees that the products that carry it are made only with natural and organic ingredients, through soft manufacturing processes and environmentally friendly practices. The NATRUE Label is awarded by NATRUE, a non-profit organisation committed to promote and protect high standards of quality and environmental integrity. See: http://www.natrue.org/home/" ;
              rdfs:label "NATRUE_LABEL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.natrue.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176788" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176789
gdsn:cv176789 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Natura-Beef refers to the meat of 10-month-old calves raised in suckler cow husbandry." ;
              rdfs:label "NATURA_BEEF" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.mutterkuh.ch/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176789" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176790
gdsn:cv176790 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Natura-Veal stands for veal from suckler cow husbandry" ;
              rdfs:label "NATURA_VEAL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.mutterkuh.ch/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176790" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176791
gdsn:cv176791 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Nature Care Product (NCP) standard applies to all products used to clean, preserve, or care for plants, utensils, textiles, and food as well as other non-food products natural origin. It is based on the requirements of the EU Regulation on Organic Agriculture number 834/2007 and 889/2008. More information available at www.natural-cosmetic.cc The standard is particularly designed for detergents and cleaning agents, leather and textile care products, sanitary products, pesticides, repellents for vertebrates and mollusks, insecticides, disinfectants, fungicides, acaricides, and fertilizers. Products used to clean, protect, or care for humans or animals are regulated by the NCS Natural Cosmetic Standard (www.natural-cosmetic.cc)." ;
              rdfs:label "NATURE_CARE_PRODUCT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.natural-cosmetics.cc/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176791" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176792
gdsn:cv176792 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Nature et Progrès operates as a PGS with its own private organic standard and its own certification procedures (involving peer review). The aim of the initiative is to grant an organic quality guarantee on the basis of its 15 different production standards (vegetable, livestock, cosmetics, wine, beer, etc.) and of its Ethical Chart, defined through a participatory approach by its members. Since 2011, these standards are part of the IFOAM Family of Standards and IFOAM - Organics International has endorsed Nature et Progrès through its PGS recognition program." ;
              rdfs:label "NATURE_ET_PROGRES" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.natureetprogres.org" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176792" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176793
gdsn:cv176793 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Naturland promotes organic agriculture the world over and its 53,000 members make it one of the major organic farming associations. As a forward-looking association, Naturland attributes the same importance to issues of social responsibility as to organic expertise." ;
              rdfs:label "NATUREPLUS" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.natureplus.org" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176793" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176794
gdsn:cv176794 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Naturland promotes organic agriculture the world over and its 53,000 members make it one of the major organic farming associations. As a forward-looking association, Naturland attributes the same importance to issues of social responsibility as to organic expertise." ;
              rdfs:label "NATURLAND" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.naturland.de/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176794" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176795
gdsn:cv176795 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Naturland established in 2005 with its social standards. It now has erected a third pillar of sustainability to provide added support to our organic association’s holistic concept: International partners can apply for certification to Naturland for fair trade standards in the course of their annual organic inspection. http://www.naturland.de/fairzertifizierung.html." ;
              rdfs:label "NATURLAND_FAIR_TRADE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.naturland.de/fairzertifizierung.html" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176795" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176796
gdsn:cv176796 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Naturland is an association of organic farmers, and develops standards for organic farming. Naturland has also developed a standard for sustainable fishing. This standard considers sustainability from a holistic perspective and includes ecological and social and economic factors, such as food quality and working conditions, in the assessment. Not only the effects of the fishing practices themselves, but also of the product processing are assessed. The assessment is carried out by an independent expert and there is a possibility for public participation. The supply chain history of the fish products is easily traceable." ;
              rdfs:label "NATURLAND_WILDFISH" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://naturland.de/de/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176796" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176797
gdsn:cv176797 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Products bearing the Natural Cosmetics Standard (NCS) label undergo in-depth tests and fulfil the highest quality requirements ensuring the products are consist of natural original materials." ;
              rdfs:label "NC_NATURAL_COSMETICS_STANDARD" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://gfaw.eu/en/certifications/ncs/ncs-product-certification-for-natural-cosmetics/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176797" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176798
gdsn:cv176798 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Products bearing the Natural Cosmetics Standard (NCS) label undergo in-depth tests and fulfil the highest quality requirements ensuring the products are consist of natural original materials and a minimum of 95% organic sources." ;
              rdfs:label "NC_NATURAL_COSMETICS_STANDARD_ORGANIC_QUALITY" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://gfaw.eu/en/certifications/ncs/ncs-product-certification-for-natural-cosmetics/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176798" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176799
gdsn:cv176799 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Products bearing the Natural Cosmetics Standard (NCS) label undergo in-depth tests and fulfil the highest quality requirements ensuring the products are consist of natural original materials, neither from nor by animal products." ;
              rdfs:label "NC_VEGAN_NATURAL_COSMETICS" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://gfaw.eu/en/certifications/ncs/ncs-product-certification-for-natural-cosmetics/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176799" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176800
gdsn:cv176800 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Products bearing the Natural Cosmetics Standard (NCS) label undergo in-depth tests and fulfil the highest quality requirements ensuring the products are consist of natural original materials with organic and vegan quality." ;
              rdfs:label "NC_VEGAN_NATURAL_COSMETICS_STANDARD_ORGANIC_QUALITY" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://gfaw.eu/en/certifications/ncs/ncs-product-certification-for-natural-cosmetics/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176800" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176801
gdsn:cv176801 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The National Celiac Association is dedicated to educating and advocating for individuals with celiac disease and non-celiac gluten sensitivities, their families, and communities throughout the nation. https://nationalceliac.org/" ;
              rdfs:label "NCA_GLUTEN_FREE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://nationalceliac.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176801" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176802
gdsn:cv176802 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Nevada Department of Agriculture (NDOA) - The Nevada Organic Certification Program provides assurance to consumers who purchase organic products by verifying that products were grown and handled according to USDA National Organic Program standards. The program also benefits Nevada's agricultural producers and handlers by providing an in-state organic certification service which allows eligible operations to market agricultural products as “organic”." ;
              rdfs:label "NDOA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://agri.nv.gov/Plant/Organic_Certification/Organic_Certification_Home/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176802" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176803
gdsn:cv176803 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "National Eczema Association Seal of Acceptance™ As a service to individuals and the corporate community, and to encourage/recognize product innovations that provide benefits and improve the quality of life for people with eczema and sensitive skin, the National Eczema Association has established the NEA Seal of Acceptance™ program." ;
              rdfs:label "NEA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://nationaleczema.org/eczema-products/about-nea-seal-of-acceptance" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176803" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176804
gdsn:cv176804 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Neuland logo marks meat and meat products which have humane and environmentally friendly livestock origin. The high demands of the marking based on guidelines, which include among others criteria on housing, feeding and transporting the animals. The seal was founded in 1988, by the Verein für tiergerechte und umwelt-schonende Nutztierhaltung e. V. Sponsors by BUND and the Arbeitsgemeinschaft Bäuerliche Landwirtschaft." ;
              rdfs:label "NEULAND" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.neuland-fleisch.de" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176804" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176805
gdsn:cv176805 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Certification: Accredited NZ Sustainable Wine. National. Relies on *self reporting and on peer pressure as wineries are given feedback on their results compared to industry averages. Strong on energy use (key benchmarking indicator), modern wineries. The goal and the work to reach it are third-party audited. However, this goal is individually set and is not communicated on the bottle. https://www.nzwine.com/en/sustainability/" ;
              rdfs:label "NEW_ZEALAND_SUSTAINABLE_WINEGROWING" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.nzwine.com/en/sustainability/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176805" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176806
gdsn:cv176806 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The NF mark is a French collective certification mark. It guarantees the quality and safety of the products and services certified. The NF mark guarantees compliance not only with current standards, but also with additional quality criteria that meet consumers' needs." ;
              rdfs:label "NF_MARQUE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.marque-nf.com" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176806" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176807
gdsn:cv176807 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "NFCA endorsed GFCP trademark – for use on products destined for sale in the United States. This is a registered trademark owned by the National Foundation for Celiac Awareness who grants exclusive rights to ACG as part of operating the Gluten-Free Certification Program." ;
              rdfs:label "NFCA_GLUTEN_FREE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.beyondceliac.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176807" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176808
gdsn:cv176808 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Note: This code is being deprecated and will be removed in a future release. Please follow the migration for correct population. The NIX18 campaign is to strengthen the social norm \"do not drink and smoke until your 18\". The initiative is from the Dutch Ministry of Health, Welfare and Sport and a large number of partners (Koninklijke Horeca Netherlands, KWF Cancer, Lung Fund, Trimbos Institute, NOC * NSF, supermarkets united in the Food Retail, GGD Netherlands, Thuiswinkel.org, the Dutch Food Safety Authority and the Ministry of Security and Justice). The campaign focuses on the whole society, in particular the area of youth." ;
              rdfs:label "NIX18" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176808" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176809
gdsn:cv176809 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Mexican Standards (NMX) are technical regulations issued by the Ministry of Economy whose application is voluntary and that allow to establish quality specifications on processes, products, services, test methods, competences, etc., as well as helping in the orientation of the consumer." ;
              rdfs:label "NMX" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.gob.mx/se/acciones-y-programas/standards" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176809" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176810
gdsn:cv176810 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "It is the symbol that allows the consumer to verify that the products comply with the official regulations of our country that apply to them. Compliance with the Official Mexican Standards (NOM) is mandatory for producers, manufacturers, importers and service providers, as they provide the consumer with confidence and confidence in the products they purchase." ;
              rdfs:label "NOM" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.gob.mx/se/acciones-y-programas/standards" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176810" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176811
gdsn:cv176811 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "EarthKosher’s non-GMO Certification Program evaluates the final product from its’ initial stages of ingredient sourcing, handling and throughout the production process until it reaches the store shelf. By evaluating and controlling the sourcing, handling, production and distribution of the the products, EarthKosher’s non-GMO Certification Program ensures that the company’s products are non-GMO compliant and safe." ;
              rdfs:label "NON_GMO_BY_EARTHKOSHER" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.earthkosher.com/certifications/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176811" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176812
gdsn:cv176812 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Non-GMO Project is a non-profit organization committed to preserving and building the non-GMO food supply, educating consumers, and providing verified non-GMO choices. The verification seal indicates that the product bearing the seal has gone through the Non-GMO Project verification process. Verification is an assurance that a product has been produced according to consensus-based best practices for GMO avoidance." ;
              rdfs:label "NON_GMO_PROJECT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.nongmoproject.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176812" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176813
gdsn:cv176813 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Natural Products Association (NPA) - The Science and Regulatory Affairs Department at NPA oversees the TruLabel® program and is charged with implementing education and certification programs—third-party certified good manufacturing practices (GMPs) for all supply members." ;
              rdfs:label "NPA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.npainfo.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176813" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176814
gdsn:cv176814 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "National Standards Foundation (NSF) accredited third-party certification provides all stakeholders – industry, regulators, users and the general public – assurance that a certified product, material, component or service complies with the technical requirements of the referenced standard. The NSF certification process is specific to the product, process or service being certified and the type of certification." ;
              rdfs:label "NSF" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.nsf.org/regulatory/regulator-nsf-certification/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176814" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176815
gdsn:cv176815 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The NSF - Certified for Sport certification includes all products that have published the NSF - Certified for Sport stamp on their package. NSF's Certified for Sport® Program helps athletes, coaches, dietitians and trainers make more informed decisions when choosing sports supplements. The program is recognized by NFL, NFLPA, MLB, MLBPA, PGA, LPGA, NHL, CPSDA, Taylor Hooton Foundation and CCES." ;
              rdfs:label "NSF_CERTIFIED_FOR_SPORT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.nsfsport.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176815" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176816
gdsn:cv176816 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Gluten is a protein found in wheat, rye and barley that is responsible for the elastic nature of dough. For many people this protein is easily digestible and has no effect on their overall health. But for those with any type of gluten intolerance, the ramifications of eating gluten can range from constipation and bloating to diarrhoea and malabsorption, which can result in malnutrition. For individuals with gluten intolerance or celiac disease, a gluten-free diet is essential. To help consumers who are looking for gluten-free products, NSF International has developed a science-based gluten-free certification program." ;
              rdfs:label "NSF_GLUTEN_FREE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.nsf.org/consumer-resources/what-is-nsf-certification/gluten-free-certification" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176816" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176817
gdsn:cv176817 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The NSF Non-GMO True North standard was created to assure the integrity of non-GMO claims and to grow the breadth and diversity of non-GMO/GE verified products sold at retail and non-GMO certified ingredients sold throughout the supply chain. NSF Non-GMO True North incorporates elements from the EU and Vermont GMO labelling requirements and pulls best practice from commonly used leading food safety standards. To access the standard, please complete the form on the right." ;
              rdfs:label "NSF_NON_GMO_TRUE_NORTH" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.nsf.org/newsroom_pdf/cvv_true_north_non_gmo_certification.pdf" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176817" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176818
gdsn:cv176818 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The NSF Sustainability certification attribute includes all products that have published the NSF Sustainability Certified seal on their packaging." ;
              rdfs:label "NSF_SUSTAINABILITY_CERTIFIED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.nsf.org/services/by-industry/sustainability-environment" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176818" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176819
gdsn:cv176819 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The national safety mark (NSM) is the property of the Government of Canada and its use is authorized by the Minister of Transport to manufacturers of new vehicles offered for sale in Canada. Transport Canada requires the manufacturers that are authorized to affix the mark, to have the capability to certify their vehicle production to comply with the regulations under the Motor Vehicle Safety Act." ;
              rdfs:label "NSM" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.tc.gc.ca/eng/motorvehiclesafety/tp-tp13136-cm-faq_e-702.htm" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176819" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176820
gdsn:cv176820 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The green key hole is to be put on the healthy foods in Sweden, Denmark, and Norway within certain product groups in order to make it easier for the customers to make a healthy choice. http://www.norden.org/" ;
              rdfs:label "NYCKELHALET" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://foedevarestyrelsen.dk/kost-og-foedevarer/alt-om-mad/gaa-efter-maerkningen/noeglehullet https://www.livsmedelsverket.se/matvanor-halsa--miljo/nyckelhalet/ https://www.mattilsynet.no/mat-og-drikke/merking-av-mat/regelverk-og-tilsyn-med-nokkelhullet" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176820" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176821
gdsn:cv176821 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Ocean Wise is a Vancouver Aquarium conservation program, created to help businesses and their customers make environmentally friendly choices. The Ocean Wise symbol next to a seafood item assures you that option is the best choice for the health of the oceans." ;
              rdfs:label "OCEAN_WISE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.oceanwise.ca/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176821" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176822
gdsn:cv176822 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Organic Crop Improvement Association (OCIA) International provides certification services to thousands of organic farmers, processors and handlers in North, Central and South America, and Asia." ;
              rdfs:label "OCIA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ocia.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176822" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176823
gdsn:cv176823 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Québec Vrai is accredited (no. AC-07-03) for certifying organic products in accordance with ISO / IEC Guide 65:1996 through the Reserved Designations and Added-Value Claims Board (CARTV). This is the only provincial authority that is responsible for the management and protection of reserved designations in Quebec. It is by virtue of the powers conferred by the Act Respecting Reserved Designations and Added-Value Claims (RSQ cA-20.03) and the recognition granted by the United States Department of Agriculture under Regulation 7 CFR § 205.500 (1) that the CARTV allows organic certification for agricultural and food products (goods and services). Québec Vrai is also accredited to verify the Chain of Custody of certified products. The requirements for organic certification are contained in the Quebec Organic Reference Standards and the National Organic Program (NOP) Regulations." ;
              rdfs:label "OCQV_ORGANIC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.quebecvrai.org/home" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176823" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176824
gdsn:cv176824 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "This Test Guideline is a screening method for the evaluation of ready biodegradability of chemicals." ;
              rdfs:label "OECD_BIO_INGREDIENTS" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.oecd.org/env/test-no-310-ready-biodegradability-co2-in-sealed-vessels-headspace-test-9789264224506-en.htm" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176824" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176825
gdsn:cv176825 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "ÖkoControl is a subsidiary of the Europäischen Verbands ökologischer Einrichtungshäuser e.V., in which about 50 ecologically engaged furniture dealers have joined forces. The objective of this eco-leading group is to provide consumers, retailers and manufacturers with more safety in a healthy living. With ÖkoControl the association has created a powerful tool to control the products offered." ;
              rdfs:label "OEKO_CONTROL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.oekocontrol.com" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176825" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176826
gdsn:cv176826 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Ökologischer Kreislauf Moorbad Harbach The label marks agricultural products grown organically that progress towards an entire organic production chain, which is both socially just and ecologically responsible." ;
              rdfs:label "OEKO_KREISLAUF" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.oeko-kreislauf.at/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176826" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176827
gdsn:cv176827 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Öko Qualität Garantiert Bayern is for products of organic farming origin in Bavaria a regional eco-label organic quality guaranteed Bavarian. This is maintained by Bayerisches Staatsministerium für Ernährung, Landwirtschaft und Forsten (StMELF)" ;
              rdfs:label "OEKO_QUALITY_GUARANTEE_BAVARIA" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.stmelf.bayern.de" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176827" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176828
gdsn:cv176828 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The OEKO-TEX® Standard 100 is a globally recognized certification that indicates textiles have been tested for harmful substances and meet stringent safety criteria. Products bearing the STANDARD 100 label are verified to be safe for human health, ensuring they contain no harmful levels of over 1,000 substances. The certification applies to every component of the product, from the fabric to the buttons and threads, making it a benchmark for textile safety and environmental protection." ;
              rdfs:label "OEKO_TEX_LABEL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.oeko-tex.com" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176828" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176829
gdsn:cv176829 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "MADE IN GREEN by OEKO-TEX® is an independent textile label for highlighting consumer products and semi-finished products at all levels of the textile chain that are made from materials tested for harmful substances and that have been manufactured by using environmentally friendly processes and under safe and socially responsible working conditions." ;
              rdfs:label "OEKO_TEX_MADE_IN_GREEN" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.oeko-tex.com/se/business/certifications_and_services/mig/mig_start.xhtml/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176829" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176830
gdsn:cv176830 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The French agricultural organizations have created a common visual identity in order to highlight the French origin of agricultural products in this case eggs: the signatures \"Agricultural Products of France\". Remarkable to their elegant silhouette in a tricolor pentagon that is available for each family of products, these signatures reflect the commitment of the professionals of the sectors to value the know-how, the territories and the French jobs. Covering a variety of productions, these signatures all have a common basis, which consists of four criteria: Origin France of the products concerned, The existence of specifications or regulations governing the use of the logo, A formal commitment from the operators of the sectors concerned wishing to use these logos, Controls performed by a third party." ;
              rdfs:label "OEUFS_DE_FRANCE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.produitsagricolesdefrance.fr" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176830" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176831
gdsn:cv176831 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "It shows that the product complies with organic regulations. The Organic Food Federation is one of the UK’s leading certification bodies operating nationally in all areas of organics.UKAS accredited to ISO/IEC 17065:2012." ;
              rdfs:label "OFF_ORGANIC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.orgfoodfed.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176831" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176832
gdsn:cv176832 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Luomo Sun Sign Denotes controlled organic production. The official label of the Finnish inspection authorities; owned by the Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry. http://opetus.ruokatieto.fi/" ;
              rdfs:label "OFFICIAL_ECO_LABEL_SUN" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.evira.fi/en/shared-topics/organic-production/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176832" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176833
gdsn:cv176833 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Organic Certification is OF&G’s main inspection and certification scheme, and is relevant to the majority of licensees. The programme is based on the European Organic Regulation which sets the core standards organic producers must adhere to across the EU (regulation EC 834/2007)." ;
              rdfs:label "OFG_ORGANIC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://ofgorganic.org/about-ofg/what-we-do/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176833" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176834
gdsn:cv176834 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "VLOG controls the “Ohne GenTechnik” product seal ­­(GM-free, produced without genetic engineering). The “Ohne GenTechnik” seal enables consumers to choose foods that have been produced without genetic engineering and to support GM-free agriculture." ;
              rdfs:label "OHNE_GEN_TECHNIK" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ohnegentechnik.org/ohne-gentechnik/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176834" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176835
gdsn:cv176835 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "On account of the comparatively small volume of waste involved, the temperature in a garden compost heap is clearly lower and less constant than in an industrial composting environment. Composting in the garden is therefore a more difficult, slower-paced process. TÜV AUSTRIA’s innovative answer to this challenge is the OK compost HOME certification system to guarantee complete biodegradability in the light of specific requirements, even in your garden compost heap." ;
              rdfs:label "OK_COMPOST_HOME" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.tuv-at.be/green-marks/certifications/ok-compost-seedling/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176835" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176836
gdsn:cv176836 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Packaging or products bearing the OK compost INDUSTRIAL label are guaranteed to be biodegradable in an industrial composting plant. This applies to all of their components, inks and additives. The sole reference point for the certification program is the harmonized EN 13432: 2000 standard: in any event, any product bearing the OK compost INDUSTRIAL logo complies with the requirements of the EU Packaging Directive (94/62/EEC)." ;
              rdfs:label "OK_COMPOST_INDUSTRIAL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.tuv-at.be/green-marks/certifications/ok-compost-seedling/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176836" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176837
gdsn:cv176837 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Packaging or products featuring the OK Compost label by Vincotte are guaranteed as biodegradable in an industrial composting plant. This applies to all components, inks and additives. The sole reference point for the certification programme is the harmonised EN 13432: 2000 standard: in any event any product featuring the OK compost logo complies with the requirements of the EU Packaging Directive (94/62/EEC)." ;
              rdfs:label "OK_COMPOST_VINCOTTE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.okcompost.be/en/home/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176837" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176838
gdsn:cv176838 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "OK Kosher Certification" ;
              rdfs:label "OK_KOSHER" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.ok.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176838" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176839
gdsn:cv176839 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Ökotest is a magazine that tests product for the health risks, side effects environmental impact. They issue labels to products which have passed their tests for safety and publish results in their magazine." ;
              rdfs:label "OKOTEST" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.oekotest.de/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176839" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176840
gdsn:cv176840 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "This quality label is used to mark vegetables, fruit, flowers, plants, trees and flowering bulbs that are grown sustainably. The label has five areas of interest: water, energy, climate, production & consumption, soil, landscape & biodiversity. The certified growers comply with super-statutory requirements for e.g. clean air, fertile soil, good water quality, more nature around farms and recycling. https://www.planetproof-international.eu/" ;
              rdfs:label "ON_THE_WAY_TO_PLANETPROOF" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.planetproof-international.eu/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176840" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176841
gdsn:cv176841 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "1% for the Planet is a global movement inspiring businesses and individuals to support environmental solutions (Education, alternative transportation, fossil fuel efficiency, etc.) through annual memberships and everyday actions." ;
              rdfs:label "ONE_PERCENT_FOR_THE_PLANET" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.onepercentfortheplanet.org/model" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176841" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176842
gdsn:cv176842 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Inspection of a food animal by an inspector in accordance with Part VIII before the animal is slaughtered; (“inspection ante mortem”)" ;
              rdfs:label "ONTARIO_APPROVED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.ontario.ca/laws/regulation/050031" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176842" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176843
gdsn:cv176843 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Ontario Pork represents over 1, 500 pork farmers across the province in consumer education, research, government representation, environmental issues, animal care and food quality assurance. Ontario Pork acts as the official spokes-group for the industry and is a source of information about all things pork and pigs." ;
              rdfs:label "ONTARIO_PORK" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://porkisyummy.wordpress.com/protein-in-the-am/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176843" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176844
gdsn:cv176844 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Orthodox Rabbinical Board (ORB)" ;
              rdfs:label "ORB" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://orbonline.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176844" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176845
gdsn:cv176845 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "ORBI Organic Bio is a community of farmers to enhance organic agriculture and is the pioneer group of organic-organic farming in Austria." ;
              rdfs:label "ORBI" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.orbi.or.at/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176845" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176846
gdsn:cv176846 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Oregon Kosher is a non-profit organization dedicated to promoting Kashrus through supervision, education, and research. certifies many food production facilities, bakeries, and wineries here in the Pacific Northwest. We have become an affordable kosher certification accepted across the globe. Oregon Kosher" ;
              rdfs:label "OREGON_KOSHER" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://oregonkosher.org/about-us/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176846" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176847
gdsn:cv176847 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Certification: LIVE Certified Sustainable. Regional, Oregon, Washington State and Idaho. The system includes creating processes and guidance documents in several categories, reporting primarily the existence of these documents and reporting use numbers to track yearly use over time. Vineyard and winery certified, wines must be 97% certified grapes. Lists red, green and yellow categories. https://livecertified.org" ;
              rdfs:label "OREGON_LIVE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://livecertified.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176847" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176848
gdsn:cv176848 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Oregon Tilth provides certification services of the highest quality that reflect and respect your dedication to organics. Regardless of where you are in the certification process, our staff is committed to providing you with excellent customer service and technical assistance to ensure that your certification experience is educational, transparent and timely." ;
              rdfs:label "OREGON_TILTH" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://tilth.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176848" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176849
gdsn:cv176849 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Organic Content Standard (OCS) relies on third-party verification to verify a final product contains the accurate amount of a given organically grown material." ;
              rdfs:label "ORGANIC_100_CONTENT_STANDARD" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://textileexchange.org/about-us/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176849" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176850
gdsn:cv176850 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Organic cotton is grown without the use of toxic and persistent pesticides, fungicides and synthetic fertilizers. *No formaldehyde is used in finishing product. *These all impact our environment and the people who have to farm the cotton as well. The organic cotton is a kinder choice to the earth and to the workers. *Organic cotton has not been exposed to metals and chemicals, and this likely gives the fabric lasting strength over time. *Organic cotton has strict standards in the way it is manufactured. We feel good about giving our dogs and yours a fabric that is grown, processed and dyed in a rigorous manner, purchased from excellent sources that meet the certification requirements of organic materials." ;
              rdfs:label "ORGANIC_COTTON" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "0" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176850" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176851
gdsn:cv176851 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Organic Trade Association on behalf of their membership, promotes and protects organic agriculture and trade through legislative and regulatory advocacy in Canada and US." ;
              rdfs:label "ORGANIC_TRADE_ASSOCIATION" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://ota.com/ https://www.canada-organic.ca/en" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176851" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176852
gdsn:cv176852 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The label indicates the \"Origin of eggs - approved by KAT\". The label guarantees the actual origin of eggs used for egg products or food production. Egg products with this label may only be produced from eggs from KAT-certified laying farms. This means that only KAT eggs may be used for the production of KAT egg products. This is the only way to guarantee a cross-stage traceability throughout the entire process chain from the laying farm to the egg product factory and the food industry." ;
              rdfs:label "ORIGIN_OF_EGGS" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.was-steht-auf-dem-ei.de/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176852" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176853
gdsn:cv176853 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Origine France Garantie certification was created in June 2010 following the publication of Yves Jégo's report on the France brand. The certification, simple and understandable by all, is the result of a collective approach of actors who wish to work together to promote the \"produce in France\" and the valorization of industrial and artisan know-how. The Pro France association which promotes Origine France Garantie is made up of business leaders supporting this initiative. Its goal is: Give clear and precise information to the consumer about the French origin of the products Make known the companies that manufacture in France The Origine France Garantie certification distinguishes itself from other mentions such as \"made in France\", \"designed in France\", \"Made in France\" ... which are self-declarative and too loose. Origine France Garantie is the only certification that certifies the French origin of a product. It is transversal (all sectors combined) and indisputable (certification, mandatory, is carried out by an independent certifying body). The Origine France Garantie certification ensures consumers traceability of the product by giving a clear and objective indication of origin. Certification is achieved through two cumulative criteria that companies must meet to obtain it: Between 50% and 100% of the unit cost is French The product takes its essential characteristics in France" ;
              rdfs:label "ORIGINE_FRANCE_GARANTIE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.originefrancegarantie.fr/ https://www.economie.gouv.fr/cedef/label-origine-france-garantie" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176853" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176854
gdsn:cv176854 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Oregon Tilth is a leading nonprofit certifier, educator and advocate for organic agriculture and products since 1974. Our mission to make our food system and agriculture biologically sound and socially equitable requires us to find practical ways to tackle big challenges. We advance this mission to balance the needs of people and planet through focus on core areas of certification, conservation, public health, policy and the marketplace." ;
              rdfs:label "OTCO_ORGANIC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://tilth.org/certification/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176854" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176855
gdsn:cv176855 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Orthodox Union: the oldest Orthodox Jewish organisations in the United States. It is best known for its kosher certification service. Its circled-U symbol, Ⓤ, a hechsher mark, is found on the labels of many kosher commercial and consumer food products. https://oukosher.org/" ;
              rdfs:label "OU_KOSHER" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://oukosher.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176855" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176856
gdsn:cv176856 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Hebrew word “kosher” means fit or proper as it relates to Jewish dietary law. Kosher foods are permitted to be eaten, and can be used as ingredients in the production of additional food items. Products bearing the OU-D logo are certified kosher by the Orthodox Union and are or contain dairy." ;
              rdfs:label "OU_KOSHER_DAIRY" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.ou.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176856" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176857
gdsn:cv176857 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Hebrew word “kosher” means fit or proper as it relates to Jewish dietary law. Kosher foods are permitted to be eaten, and can be used as ingredients in the production of additional food items. Products bearing the OU-Fish logo are certified kosher by the Orthodox Union and are or contain fish." ;
              rdfs:label "OU_KOSHER_FISH" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.ou.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176857" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176858
gdsn:cv176858 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Hebrew word “kosher” means fit or proper as it relates to Jewish dietary law. Kosher foods are permitted to be eaten, and can be used as ingredients in the production of additional food items. Products bearing the OU-Meat logo are certified kosher by the Orthodox Union and are or contain meat." ;
              rdfs:label "OU_KOSHER_MEAT" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.ou.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176858" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176859
gdsn:cv176859 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Hebrew word “kosher” means fit or proper as it relates to Jewish dietary law. Kosher foods are permitted to be eaten, and can be used as ingredients in the production of additional food items. Products bearing the OU-P logo are certified kosher for Passover by the Orthodox Union." ;
              rdfs:label "OU_KOSHER_PASSOVER" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.ou.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176859" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176860
gdsn:cv176860 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "A mark or label on a trade item communicating that the trade item itself, associated production processes and/or packaging do not produce gases that are harmful to the ozone layer during the trade item’s entire life cycle. There is currently no standard definition for the term. There is no organization independently certifying this claim. The producer or manufacturer decides and self-declares to use the claim and is not free from its own self-interest." ;
              rdfs:label "OZONE_FRIENDLY_GENERAL_CLAIM" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "0" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176860" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176861
gdsn:cv176861 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The PACS is an incorporated society within the province of British Columbia and as a not for profit society is controlled by the clients it serves. As there are no profits, fees are tied directly to costs. The PACS has a number of programs including Canada Organic Regime organic certification, which gives clients the option of exporting to other provinces, the USA and overseas. We certify enterprises Canada wide." ;
              rdfs:label "PACS_ORGANIC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.pacscertifiedorganic.ca/index.html" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176861" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176862
gdsn:cv176862 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Paleo Foundation was first organized for the purpose of helping Paleo Diet Adherents easily identify products that met the basic tenets of the diet. The Paleo Approved Certification Program certifies Farms and Ranches that meet requirements for species-appropriate diet, and environmentally beneficial husbandry practices. Differing from other Paleo Certifications, Paleo Approved Standards vary by species." ;
              rdfs:label "PALEO_APPROVED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://paleofoundation.com/certified-paleo/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176862" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176863
gdsn:cv176863 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "EarthKosher offers joint Kosher + Paleo certification. What further distinguishes the EarthKosher Paleo certified symbol, is that EarthKosher actually inspects certified companies on an ongoing basis to insure that they strictly comply with Paleo standards. This approach exceeds the standards of other forms of Paleo Certification, which simply ask for a list of ingredients,and based on this alone, provide Paleo Certification." ;
              rdfs:label "PALEO_BY_EARTHKOSHER" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.earthkosher.com/certifications/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176863" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176864
gdsn:cv176864 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Parent Tested Parent Approved is about putting your product in the hands of real parents, listening to their honest opinions and letting your new brand advocates spread the word about how awesome your product is for families" ;
              rdfs:label "PARENT_TESTED_PARENT_APPROVED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://ptpa.com/ptpa-seal-of-approval/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176864" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176865
gdsn:cv176865 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "It is the collective brand involving all the actors of the French fishing valuing its trades, its commitments and its products. It is supported by the association \"France Filière Pêche\", an association of interprofessional nature, that is to say which gathers all the links of the sector" ;
              rdfs:label "PAVILLON_FRANCE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.pavillonfrance.fr/ https://www.francefilierepeche.fr/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176865" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176866
gdsn:cv176866 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Pennsylvania Certified Organic (PCO) is a USDA-accredited organic certifying agency that educates and certifies growers, processors and handlers of organic crops, wild crops, livestock and livestock products in Pennsylvania and adjoining states." ;
              rdfs:label "PCO" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://www.paorganic.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176866" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176867
gdsn:cv176867 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Programme for Endorsement of Forest Certification (PEFCC_ is an international non-profit, non-governmental organisation dedicated to promoting Sustainable Forest Management (SFM) through independent third-party certification" ;
              rdfs:label "PEFC" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.pefc.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176867" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176868
gdsn:cv176868 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "PEFC Programme for the Endorsement of Forest Certification Schemes PEFC Certified: at least 70% of wood from PEFC-certified forests that meets or exceeds PEFC’s Sustainability Benchmark requirements and recycled material; and wood from controlled sources. The overall content of recycled material shall not be higher than 85%. Where the product does not include recycled material, the label claim shall be used without the world 'recycled'." ;
              rdfs:label "PEFC_CERTIFIED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.pefc.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176868" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176869
gdsn:cv176869 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "PEFC Programme for the Endorsement of Forest Certification Schemes: PEFC Recycled at least 70%, PEFC certified material from recycled sources; and wood from controlled sources." ;
              rdfs:label "PEFC_RECYCLED" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.pefc.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176869" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


