###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176911
gdsn:cv176911 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The California Milk Advisory Board (CMAB), an instrumentality of the California Department of Food and Agriculture, exists for one purpose: to spread the word about the extraordinary dairy products made with Real California Milk. This label states that this is made with Califiornian cheese." ;
              rdfs:label "REAL_CALIFORNIA_CHEESE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.realcaliforniamilk.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176911" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176912
gdsn:cv176912 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The California Milk Advisory Board (CMAB), an instrumentality of the California Department of Food and Agriculture, exist for one purpose: to spread the word about the extraordinary dairy products made with Real California Milk." ;
              rdfs:label "REAL_CALIFORNIA_MILK" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.realcaliforniamilk.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176912" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176913
gdsn:cv176913 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The dairy industry four decades ago created the REAL® Seal. It’s an assurance that you are buying a genuine dairy product, made with milk from cows on U.S. dairy farms, and meeting strict manufacturing requirements." ;
              rdfs:label "REAL_FOOD_SEAL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.realseal.com/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176913" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176914
gdsn:cv176914 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Recupel strives in Belgium for a better environment through optimal recovery of materials from waste of electrical devices. Recupel ensures that waste of electrical appliances are collected and processed in a sustainable and cost-effective manner." ;
              rdfs:label "RECUPEL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.recupel.be" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176914" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176915
gdsn:cv176915 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "A generic Recycling codes are used to identify the material from which an item is made, to facilitate easier recycling or other reprocessing. Multiple agencies use this design." ;
              rdfs:label "RECYCLABLE_GENERAL_CLAIM" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.cen.eu/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176915" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176916
gdsn:cv176916 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Mark accredited by Czech Ministry of Agriculture to the best quality agricultural or food products from each region of the Czech Republic." ;
              rdfs:label "REGIONAL_FOOD_CZECH" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.regionalnipotravina.cz/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176916" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176917
gdsn:cv176917 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Products that bear the \"Regionalfenster\" for food, ensure greater transparency. Consumers can identify with the logo at a glance which foods actually come from the region indicated on the packaging. This gives consumers a nationwide uniform and reliable identification of regional products. The initiative was started by Bundesministerium für Ernährung, Landwirtschaft und Verbraucherschutz (BMELV)." ;
              rdfs:label "REGIONALFENSTER" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.regionalfenster.de/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176917" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176918
gdsn:cv176918 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The logo \"Regionaltheke Franken\" identifies products by Frankish farmers and documented to be of regional origin and quality of agricultural products and services in this area. The quality criteria go in relation to the proof of origin partly legal specifications as well. The logo is pursuing a criteria and control system for regional products with the involvement of the Bundesverbands der Regionalbewegungen." ;
              rdfs:label "REGIONALTHEKE_FRANKEN" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.aelf-ba.bayern.de/erwerbskombination/21976/index.php" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176918" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176919
gdsn:cv176919 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Statiegeld Nederland is an organisation for the Dutch can deposit. The logo informs the consumers and collection points that a package deposit is charged and registered in the deposit system. The use of the logo is mandatory on cans the start of 2023." ;
              rdfs:label "RETURNABLE_CAN_NL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.statiegeldnederland.nl" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176919" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176920
gdsn:cv176920 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Statiegeld Nederland is the implementing organization for the Dutch deposit system for large and small PET bottles of soft drinks and water. The use of the logo is mandatory on large and small PET bottles from 1 July 2021, which are charged with a deposit and are registered in the deposit system. The logo makes it clear to consumers and collection points whether or not a package has a deposit associated with it." ;
              rdfs:label "RETURNABLE_PET_BOTTLE_NL" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.statiegeldnederland.nl" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176920" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176921
gdsn:cv176921 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "This quality mark is managed by the Foundation RHP. RHP optimizes and secures the quality of peat products, raw materials, potting soil compositions, substrates, soil supply and soil improvers." ;
              rdfs:label "RHP" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "www.rhp.nl" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176921" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176922
gdsn:cv176922 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Roquefort is a cheese made from raw, whole ewe's milk, blue-veined and with a natural rind, produced exclusively in a large part of the department of Aveyron and a few communes in the departments of Aude, Lozère, Gard, Hérault and Tarn in the Occitanie region." ;
              rdfs:label "ROQUEFORT_RED_EWE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://ec.europa.eu/agriculture/quality/door/registeredName.html?denominationId=626 http://www.soyez-roquefort.fr/laop/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176922" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176923
gdsn:cv176923 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Round Table on Responsible Soy is a civil organisation that promotes responsible production, processing and trading of soy on a global level. Encourage current and future soybean is produced in a responsible manner to reduce social and environmental impacts while maintaining or improving the economic status for the producer. Through: • The development, implementation and verification of a global standard • The commitment of the stakeholders involved in the value chain of soybean. That soy help to meet social needs, environmental and economic consequences of the present generation without compromising the resources and the welfare of future generations and allowing the construction of a better world through consensus and joint action." ;
              rdfs:label "ROUNDTABLE_ON_RESPONSIBLE_SOY" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.responsiblesoy.org" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176923" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176924
gdsn:cv176924 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Roundtable on Sustainable Biomaterials (RSB) is a global, multi-stakeholder independent organisation that drives the development of a new world bioeconomy through sustainability solutions, certification, and collaborative partnerships. It provides tools and solutions that mitigate business risk and contribute to achieving the UN’s Sustainable Development Goals and has the world’s most trusted, peer-reviewed, global certification standard for sustainable biomaterials, biofuels and biomass production." ;
              rdfs:label "RSB" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "http://www.rsb.org/" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176924" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


###  urn:gs1:std:gdsn:cv176925
gdsn:cv176925 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       gdsn:c-1409540287 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "The Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union (TFEU) recognises the structural situation, economic and social development of the outermost regions: nine regions located in three States members: the Azores and Madeira for Portugal, the Canary Islands for Spain, Guadeloupe, the French Guiana, Martinique, Mayotte, Reunion Island, and Saint Martin for France. These outermost regions benefit from specific measures adapting European law to local needs and remoteness from the metropolitan territory. These measures include, from 1991, the principle of creating a specific symbol to make products better known and food production in these regions. This is the graphic symbol of the regions ultra-peripherals or RUP logo integrated in the Remote Specific Options Program and Insularity (POSEI)." ;
              rdfs:label "RUP_GUADELOUPE" ;
              gdsn:codeListName "PackagingMarkedLabelAccreditationCode" ;
              gdsn:externalLink "https://agriculture.gouv.fr/telecharger/101375?token=28a3beb9da4b2f8f43323871623b66bc" ;
              gdsn:sourceId "176925" ;
              gdsn:sourceType "codeValue" .


