              rdfs:comment "The Sustainable Furnishings Council (SFC) Member Seal is a label representing those companies which have made a public and verifiable commitment to sustainability and to improvement. These companies are involved in the home furnishings industry. The Exemplary status is voluntary - all members make a public and verifiable commitment to sustainability, to transparency, and to continuous improvement. This seal is for platinum level members." ;
              rdfs:label "SFC_MEMBER_SEAL_PLATINUM" ;
