              rdfs:comment "Recycling scheme code 3 relates to Polyvinyl chlorides. These recyclables represent pipe, window profile, siding, fencing, flooring, shower curtains, lawn chairs, non-food bottles and children's toys which can be extensively recycled in Europe." ;
