              rdfs:comment "Recycling scheme code 4 relates to Low-density polyethylenes. These recyclables represent plastic bags, 6 pack rings, various containers, dispensing bottles, wash bottles, tubing, and various moulded laboratory equipment which is not often recycled through curb side programs, but some communities will accept it. Plastic shopping bags can be returned to many stores for recycling." ;
              rdfs:label "4" ;
