              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "A perfectly round geometrical object in three-dimensional space, such as the shape of a round ball. Like a circle in two dimensions, a perfect sphere is completely symmetrical around its centre, with all points on the surface lying the same distance from the centre point." ;
