              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Liquidised food that can be eaten with a spoon or drunk from a cup. It has a smooth texture with no \"bit\" (lumps, fibers, husk, bits of shell or skin, particles of gristle or bone)." ;
