              rdfs:comment "A leaflet or brochure containing important information to patients/consumers about the product to facilitate discussion and assist with the decision-making process. Example: A leaflet on a medical device like a hip joint. Or a consumer/patient-focused leaflet that contains information on the safe and effective use of a medicines. Often known in some markets as Consumer Medicines Information sheet (CMI), Product Information Leaflet (PiL/ePIL)." ;
              rdfs:label "PATIENT_INFORMATION_LEAFLET" ;
