                       gdsn:c58572829 ;
              dct:source "gdsn_codeValues.json" ;
              rdfs:comment "Document which describes how the supplier assured the quality control of the end products or during the production process. The process can be a supplier internal control system, a simple kind of risk analysis or systematic preventive approach according Hazard Analysis and Critical Control Points (HACCP)." ;
