              rdfs:comment "Identifies food (e.g. meat, cold cut, cheese) or non-food product (e.g. chain, textile) that have been already cut, sliced or chopped for sale by the time they reach the retailer. Example: loin or chuck transported as steaks into the shop where these are sold as products." ;
