              rdfs:comment "The term hypersensitivity is used in medicine to describe a general hypersensitivity of the skin to certain microorganisms, substances or stimuli. Hypersensitivity is a generic term for allergy, pseudo-allergy, intolerance and idiosyncrasy." ;
